{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/creek-bay-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1342,"crm_id":"6952","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Creek Bay","slug":"creek-bay-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":1790000,"display_price":"1.79M","lattitude":25.200345445852,"longitude":55.34674064658,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Creek Bay at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-creek-harbour/\">Dubai Creek Harbour</a> introduces a refined waterfront address developed by Emaar Properties, comprising three architecturally distinct towers. Tower A and B have been launched, offering a total of 568 residential units, including elegantly designed <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments</strong>. With a 10% down payment and strong potential for high capital appreciation, it presents a compelling opportunity within a prime waterfront district.</p><p>At Creek Bay by Emaar Properties, contemporary architecture harmonises with sweeping water views, lush greenery, and proximity to Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary. Residences are complemented by swimming pools, a common garden, play areas, and indoor &amp; outdoor fitness zones. Backed by the credibility of a globally recognised developer, the project reflects design excellence and long-term value.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_9319c477ec.jpg","hash":"Feature_9319c477ec","name":"Creek Bay at Dubai Creek Harbour Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_e7b96c7596.jpg","hash":"Banner_e7b96c7596"