r consistent appreciation and long-term investment value.</p><p>Emaar-Crafted Quality – Delivered by Emaar Properties, ensuring trusted development standards and world-class design.</p><p>Lifestyle-Rich Amenities – Experience pools, play areas, padel courts, fitness zones, and landscaped gardens inspired by active wellbeing.</p><p>Harmonious Interiors – Light-filled layouts and warm finishes create soothing spaces complemented by subtle modern detailing.</p><p>10% Down Payment – Secure a premium waterfront residence with an accessible entry point for end-users and investors.</p><p>Seamless Connectivity – Quick access to Ras Al Khor Road, Downtown Dubai, DXB Airport, and Dubai Marina.</p><p>Nature-Framed Serenity – Close to Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary with uninterrupted views of flamingos, lagoons, and Dubai’s skyline.</p>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1918,"cta":{"id":2728,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":null,"isExternal":false,"custom_link":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_cb14ae4250.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_cb14ae4250","name":"Creek Bay by Emaar Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Waterfront Living Connected to the City","heading":"CREEK BAY LOCATION","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Creek Bay by Emaar Properties is located in Dubai Creek Harbour, offering seamless access to Ras Al Khor Road (E44).&nbsp;</p><p>Set alongside the Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, the community delivers a rare balance of scenic views, walkable promenades, a world-class marina, and easy access to both Downtown Dubai and the city’s historic Creek.&nbsp;</p><p>With major future landmarks like the Dubai Creek Tower and continuous infrastructure development underway, the area is rapidly becoming a high-demand investment hub.&nbsp;</p><ul><li>5 Minutes – Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary</li><li>10 Minutes – Dubai Internati